(WINGSPAN - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Players are bird enthusiasts who attract birds to their wildlife preserve. The game) Tj T*
(lasts 4 rounds. Each bird card adds a power to one of three habitats: forest,) Tj T*
(grassland or wetland.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Each player gets 5 bird cards, 2 bonus cards and 5 food tokens \(one of each type\).) Tj T*
(Keep up to 5 birds; for each bird kept, discard 1 food token. Keep 1 bonus card. Roll) Tj T*
(the 5 dice into the birdfeeder.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ACTIONS) Tj T*
(In round 1 you have 8 action cubes, then 7, 6 and 5. Each turn you use one cube for) Tj T*
(one action:) Tj T*
(- Play a bird: pay its food cost and an egg cost depending on the column \(0, 1, 1, 2,) Tj T*
(   2 eggs\).) Tj T*
(- Gain food: take dice from the birdfeeder \(forest row\).) Tj T*
(- Lay eggs: put eggs on birds that have room \(grassland row\).) Tj T*
(- Draw bird cards: from the tray or the deck \(wetland row\).) Tj T*
ET
