(ACTIVATING A HABITAT) Tj T*
(When you use the forest, grassland or wetland action, put your cube in the leftmost) Tj T*
(empty space of that row and take the base reward. Then activate the brown powers of) Tj T*
(the birds in that row, from right to left. Each power is optional.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OTHER POWERS) Tj T*
(- White powers act once, when the bird is played.) Tj T*
(- Pink powers act once between your turns, when the condition happens.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BIRDFEEDER) Tj T*
(If the birdfeeder is empty, or all remaining dice show the same face, you may reroll) Tj T*
(all dice before taking food.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF A ROUND) Tj T*
(Score the round goal, then remove one action cube for the next round.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(FINAL SCORING) Tj T*
(Points on bird cards, bonus cards, round goals, 1 point per egg, 1 point per food) Tj T*
(cached on a bird and 1 point per card tucked under a bird. The most points wins; on a) Tj T*
(tie, the most unused food wins.) Tj T*
ET
